        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 79.32,
          "end": 81.66,
          "en": "But let's focus on relational one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "If you want to store this data in a relational database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 88.779,
          "en": "and we have seen that in JDBC, we can use Oracle, Postgres,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.779,
          "end": 91.5,
          "en": "MySQL, there are a bunch of DBMS available there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 91.5,
          "end": 94.83,
          "en": "And if you want to store this data, we have to use SQL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 97.65,
          "en": "And then in JDBC, we have seen if you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 97.65,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "to store the data of the object in the database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "we have to write queries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "And okay, when I say queries, what I mean by that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 106.08,
          "en": "So let's say if you want to insert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 108.72,
          "en": "so you'll say insert into table, which is let's say student",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.72,
          "end": 110.75999999999999,
          "en": "and then you will pass the values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.75999999999999,
          "end": 114.12,
          "en": "Now since this data is stored in the variables",
