        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 114.12,
          "end": 117.50999999999999,
          "en": "of the object, you have to manually fetch them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 117.50999999999999,
          "end": 120.9,
          "en": "put that in that query, and then execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 120.9,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "Tedious task, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 121.89,
          "end": 123.78,
          "en": "So the first problem is as a Java developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 123.78,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "we always think about object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 129.9,
          "en": "Then as a Java developer, we have to understand SQL as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 129.9,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "And of course you should know SQL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 133.38,
          "en": "but do we have to master it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 133.38,
          "end": 135.3,
          "en": "Do we have to remember all the queries?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 135.3,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "And what about the optimization? What about the caching?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "So if you wanna do that as a developer in the SQL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.2,
          "en": "I mean with JDBC, we have to do lot of steps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 144.2,
          "end": 147.18,
          "en": "And this is where Hibernate comes into picture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 147.18,
          "end": 150.727,
          "en": "or the ORM framework comes into picture by saying,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 150.727,
          "end": 152.16,
          "en": "\"Don't worry, I'm there.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 152.16,
          "end": 154.07999999999998,
          "en": "So what your ORM does, so ORM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 154.07999999999998,
          "end": 156.187,
          "en": "which is object relational mapping, says,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 156.187,
          "end": 158.13,
          "en": "\"Okay, you got the object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 158.13,
          "end": 161.22,
          "en": "What if I give you an option of take the object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 161.22,
          "end": 162.99,
          "en": "and put that in database?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 165.517,
          "en": "So something like this, let's say you talk to ORM by saying,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 165.517,
          "end": 169.38,
          "en": "\"Hey, ORM, save this object,\" and ORM says done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 169.38,
          "end": 170.73,
          "en": "Don't you think that will be amazing?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 170.73,
          "end": 174.21,
          "en": "And that's what ORM framework does, specifically Hibernate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 174.21,
          "end": 176.57999999999998,
          "en": "But question arise how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 176.57999999999998,
          "end": 179.25,
          "en": "So what your Hibernate does is it takes your",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 179.25,
          "end": 180.87,
          "en": "object and understands it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 180.87,
          "end": 182.76,
          "en": "So basically, how do you understand the object?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 182.76,
          "end": 184.02,
          "en": "With its blueprint",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "and the blueprint of the object is a class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 188.82,
          "en": "Now let's say if I give you this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 190.53,
          "en": "which is a student class, a very simple one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 190.53,
          "end": 192.36,
          "en": "it has three variables let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 192.36,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "Let's say roll number, name and age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 196.98,
          "en": "And now of course with this variable you have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 196.98,
          "end": 199.35,
          "en": "if you create this object of student,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 199.35,
          "end": 201.27,
          "en": "let's say we got few students here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 201.27,
          "end": 202.56,
          "en": "and they have their own data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 202.56,
          "end": 204.637,
          "en": "Now if I ask you as a viewer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 204.637,
          "end": 207.96,
          "en": "\"Hey, you know I want a table to store this data.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 210.307,
          "en": "Now you will be asking me some questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
