          "end": 212.73,
          "en": "\"Hey, you know, you asking me to create a table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 212.73,
          "end": 216.78,
          "en": "First, tell me what do you want the table name to be?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 216.78,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "Okay, that's the first question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "Next, let's say if you decide to go with a table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "and you have given some name, how many columns you need,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 226.41,
          "en": "then even if you decide the number of columns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 226.41,
          "end": 228.54,
          "en": "what should the name of the columns?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 228.54,
          "end": 230.49,
          "en": "And even if you decide what's the name of the column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 230.49,
          "end": 232.56,
          "en": "what should be the type of it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 232.56,
          "end": 234.54,
          "en": "And let's say if you have created the table,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 234.54,
          "end": 235.65,
          "en": "what about data?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 235.65,
          "end": 237.3,
          "en": "How will you, I mean, how will you represent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 237.3,
          "end": 238.35,
          "en": "those data in a row?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 238.35,
          "end": 240.15,
          "en": "And that's why we have to do this mapping.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 240.15,
          "end": 242.73,
          "en": "Now look at this class. The class name is student.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 242.73,
          "end": 245.58,
          "en": "So don't you think your table name can be student?",
