        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 272.43,
          "end": 275.46,
          "en": "And that's how basically your ORM works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 275.46,
          "end": 277.92,
          "en": "And to implement this, we have to use a tool.",
