        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 283.14,
          "end": 285.54,
          "en": "We'll see that in the upcoming videos,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 285.54,
          "end": 286.83,
          "en": "but that's the basic idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 286.83,
          "end": 288.09000000000003,
          "en": "That's how we do the mapping.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 288.09000000000003,
          "end": 290.28,
          "en": "And Hibernate is not just for this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 290.28,
          "end": 292.38,
          "en": "it also provides you different features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 292.38,
          "end": 294.57,
          "en": "So first of all, it helps you with the productivity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 294.57,
          "end": 297.03,
          "en": "It is easier to maintain the Hibernate codes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 297.03,
          "end": 298.92,
          "en": "because it is all, everything is abstracted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 298.92,
          "end": 300.92,
          "en": "You don't have to write the SQL queries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 301.79,
          "end": 304.53,
          "en": "So if you just see the methods and if you work with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 304.53,
          "end": 305.363,
          "en": "you'll be happy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 305.363,
          "end": 306.36,
          "en": "It's easy to put.",
          "zh": ""
